WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:08,000
Miss Song, please wait a moment

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,190
Zi Luo, you believe me, don't you?

3
00:00:11,190 --> 00:00:15,190
I heard that a group of red horses suddenly went crazy this afternoon

4
00:00:15,190 --> 00:00:16,190
Almost hurt Arin

5
00:00:16,190 --> 00:00:18,190
It was Miss Song who reminded me in time

6
00:00:18,190 --> 00:00:21,190
It didn't cause fatal damage to Alin, right?

7
00:00:21,190 --> 00:00:23,190
Yes, I saved Lulin this afternoon

8
00:00:23,190 --> 00:00:26,960
Zi Luo, thank you for speaking for me

9
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:28,960
But I'm not a person seeking revenge for evil benefactors

10
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:30,960
I just hope everyone can look at this matter

11
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:32,960
Give me a little basic trust and respect

12
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:35,960
At least give me a chance to explain

13
00:00:35,960 --> 00:00:39,370
I think Miss Song also misunderstood

14
00:00:39,370 --> 00:00:41,370
I don't mean to speak for you

15
00:00:41,370 --> 00:00:42,370
But I want to ask you

16
00:00:42,370 --> 00:00:44,370
Why are those horses' buttocks widened?

17
00:00:44,370 --> 00:00:46,370
There will be an earring for girls

18
00:00:46,370 --> 00:00:49,370
As far as I know, the girls who entered the racecourse today

19
00:00:49,370 --> 00:00:51,370
You should be the only one

20
00:00:51,370 --> 00:00:54,700
what do you mean

21
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:56,700
Do you want to talk about this earring?

22
00:00:56,700 --> 00:00:57,700
I got it on the horse's butt myself.

23
00:00:57,700 --> 00:00:58,700
Are you trying to make her crazy on purpose?

24
00:00:58,700 --> 00:00:59,700
Just a reasonable guess

25
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:02,700
I have a witness about this matter

26
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:04,700
You might as well let her come in and reminisce with Miss Song

27
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:09,520
Master, it’s her

28
00:01:09,520 --> 00:01:11,520
When she came to me to save Mr. Lu

29
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:13,520
I clearly saw something on her earlobe

30
00:01:13,520 --> 00:01:14,520
flashed

31
00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:15,520
But then he disappeared again
